<title>USA: Kimco closes purchase of Clover assets.</title>
<headline>Kimco closes purchase of Clover assets.</headline>
<dateline>NEW HYDE PARK, N.Y. 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kimco Realty Corp said on Wednesday it had closed on its $21.8 million purchase of the real estate assets of the Clover division of Strawbridge &amp; Clothier.</p>
<p>The portfolio acquired comprises 16 retail properties aggregating approximately 1.7 million square feet of leasable space in the Greater Philadelphia area, Kimco said.</p>
<p>Kimco said it has leased six of the former Clover locations to Kohl's Corp.</p>
<p>Three additional Strawbridge &amp; Clothier locations may be purchased by Kimco if certain conditions are met, Kimco said.</p>
</text>
